(1833085, 252111, 29269, '<td valign="top">Hey, the bottom guy is lagging! <br/>Seriously, though, wonderful capture. Sure meets the challenge, as these are fast birds. For some reason, shots of airplanes may not score too high, just because of the lack of the wow-factor overall. While it is great capture, there are only planes in it and no other objects of interest.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Hey, the bottom guy is lagging! Seriously, though, wonderful capture. Sure meets the challenge, as these are fast birds. For some reason, shots of airplanes may not score too high, just because of the lack of the wow-factor overall. While it is great capture, there are only planes in it and no other objects of interest.Good luck!', '2005-11-02 12:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833088, 250004, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. It may suffer from the DNMC, as it is not obvious (other than from the star-effect on the lights caused by really small aperture) that this is a long exposure. Still the image has appeal, and that is ultimately what prevails. Good luck!</td>', 'Nice capture. It may suffer from the DNMC, as it is not obvious (other than from the star-effect on the lights caused by really small aperture) that this is a long exposure. Still the image has appeal, and that is ultimately what prevails. Good luck!', '2005-11-02 12:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
