(1833803, 252504, 46001, '<td valign="top">Funny and great shot! But how can this be a play in shutter speeds? More like an exposure exercise.</td>', 'Funny and great shot! But how can this be a play in shutter speeds? More like an exposure exercise.', '2005-11-02 15:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833804, 251870, 45857, '<td valign="top">Create an unique sports action shot by selecting an unique sport..good idea</td>', 'Create an unique sports action shot by selecting an unique sport..good idea', '2005-11-02 15:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833805, 252016, 46001, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2005-11-02 15:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833813, 251800, 29269, '<td valign="top">The colors are hurting my eyes. I do not think that such hue shift helps the shutter speed effect that this challenge is all about.</td>', 'The colors are hurting my eyes. I do not think that such hue shift helps the shutter speed effect that this challenge is all about.', '2005-11-02 15:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833816, 252246, 29269, '<td valign="top">This is freaky-cool/ finally a different take on the challenge. Top-10 in my book, but probably controversial enough to ribbon. I hope I''m wrong! Good Luck!</td>', 'This is freaky-cool/ finally a different take on the challenge. Top-10 in my book, but probably controversial enough to ribbon. I hope I''m wrong! Good Luck!', '2005-11-02 15:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833824, 251000, 29269, '<td valign="top">When doing a trail of taillights, it is not easy to get a dramatic photo effect. This one has it. Also, it could lose the bottom completely, it serves no purpose whatsoever. If cropped up to the bottom of the road, could have been even better.</td>', 'When doing a trail of taillights, it is not easy to get a dramatic photo effect. This one has it. Also, it could lose the bottom completely, it serves no purpose whatsoever. If cropped up to the bottom of the road, could have been even better.', '2005-11-02 15:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833830, 252246, 45857, '<td valign="top">Stark dramatic image, but don''t see how this interperts ''motion''</td>', 'Stark dramatic image, but don''t see how this interperts ''motion''', '2005-11-02 15:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833831, 252470, 29269, '<td valign="top">Another where''s the polaris shot - this one much better. Could have shed some light on the trees for increased effect (a low-power flash or a stronger flashlight or reflector). But it is nice photo as is.</td>', 'Another where''s the polaris shot - this one much better. Could have shed some light on the trees for increased effect (a low-power flash or a stronger flashlight or reflector). But it is nice photo as is.', '2005-11-02 15:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833837, 251698, 45857, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors</td>', 'Beautiful colors', '2005-11-02 15:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833841, 252465, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice stop-action. It looks like it is going to fall down. No panning effect, though, but it is hard to get the best of two worlds - you obviously picked shorter exposure for a better freeze frame. There is a problem, with the sky and the trees in the top-left. That is bringing some point deductions.</td>', 'Nice stop-action. It looks like it is going to fall down. No panning effect, though, but it is hard to get the best of two worlds - you obviously picked shorter exposure for a better freeze frame. There is a problem, with the sky and the trees in the top-left. That is bringing some point deductions.', '2005-11-02 15:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833845, 250309, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice starry sky shot, with enough of other interesting details to differentiate this one from the other similar shots. Congrats and good luck.</td>', 'Nice starry sky shot, with enough of other interesting details to differentiate this one from the other similar shots. Congrats and good luck.', '2005-11-02 15:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833852, 252418, 29269, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot and freeze-frame but - the main focus should have been the guy jumping through the ring, not the #3 holding it. This should have been a winner of the challenge, if only done right. Better luck next time.</td>', 'Very nice shot and freeze-frame but - the main focus should have been the guy jumping through the ring, not the #3 holding it. This should have been a winner of the challenge, if only done right. Better luck next time.', '2005-11-02 15:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833860, 252308, 45857, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of your dog, but don''t see how it expresses ''motion''.<br/>Also you might want to clean his face next time, ''eye snot''</td>', 'Nice picture of your dog, but don''t see how it expresses ''motion''.Also you might want to clean his face next time, ''eye snot''', '2005-11-02 15:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833874, 251627, 45857, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture, great perspective. I''m not sure how you meant to interpert motion with this shot. If you wanted to use a fast shutter to freeze motion, then it wasn''t fast enough, or the water was to far away to really show it. If you were trying to use a slower shutter speed to ''blur'' the motion then your exposure was too fast.</td>', 'Beautiful picture, great perspective. I''m not sure how you meant to interpert motion with this shot. If you wanted to use a fast shutter to freeze motion, then it wasn''t fast enough, or the water was to far away to really show it. If you were trying to use a slower shutter speed to ''blur'' the motion then your exposure was too fast.', '2005-11-02 15:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1833886, 251971, 45857, '<td valign="top">Fascinating abstract</td>', 'Fascinating abstract', '2005-11-02 16:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
