(1833895, 251170, 41794, '<td valign="top">Wish it was a little closer. Foreground tree on the left is a little distracting. But I know how difficult it can be to photograph a startled doe, so it is understandable!</td>', 'Wish it was a little closer. Foreground tree on the left is a little distracting. But I know how difficult it can be to photograph a startled doe, so it is understandable!', '2005-11-02 16:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
