(1834059, 252275, 9809, '<td valign="top">Compelling photograph and well composed -- would even be better if Mustang wasn''t so trashed. I''m having a problem understanding how this meets the challenge of "shutter speed" though. This photo appears taken during the day (no long exposure necessary) and nothing in motion is frozen or blurred -- well, nothing is in motion to be frozen or blurred -- just doesn''t seem to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Compelling photograph and well composed -- would even be better if Mustang wasn''t so trashed. I''m having a problem understanding how this meets the challenge of "shutter speed" though. This photo appears taken during the day (no long exposure necessary) and nothing in motion is frozen or blurred -- well, nothing is in motion to be frozen or blurred -- just doesn''t seem to meet the challenge.', '2005-11-02 17:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
