(1834526, 252359, 13688, '<td valign="top">i found this very interesting. i really like the shadow on the wall and how it balances her final image in the series. i also like how her shirt line enforces the lines of the walls.  i only wish her initial figure was more washed out like the next few as it currently is only distracting imo.  more space above the hands might help the composition as well.  all in all still intriguing</td>', 'i found this very interesting. i really like the shadow on the wall and how it balances her final image in the series. i also like how her shirt line enforces the lines of the walls.  i only wish her initial figure was more washed out like the next few as it currently is only distracting imo.  more space above the hands might help the composition as well.  all in all still intriguing', '2005-11-02 20:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834543, 252355, 45857, '<td valign="top">Extremely interesting image, I get plenty of emotion from it, but don''t understand how this shows ''motion''</td>', 'Extremely interesting image, I get plenty of emotion from it, but don''t understand how this shows ''motion''', '2005-11-02 20:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834547, 251559, 46467, '<td valign="top">Ghooool, er, cooool photo but maybe placed in the wrong challenge.</td>', 'Ghooool, er, cooool photo but maybe placed in the wrong challenge.', '2005-11-02 20:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834554, 251686, 46467, '<td valign="top">Real neat!!</td>', 'Real neat!!', '2005-11-02 20:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834562, 252487, 45857, '<td valign="top">Tough call, your shutter speed helps show the passage of time, which I guess is a type of motion. Certainly atypical.</td>', 'Tough call, your shutter speed helps show the passage of time, which I guess is a type of motion. Certainly atypical.', '2005-11-02 20:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834589, 252474, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice rich colors!  Pretty pic.</td>', 'Nice rich colors!  Pretty pic.', '2005-11-02 20:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834592, 252111, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great clarity!  Nice capture.</td>', 'Great clarity!  Nice capture.', '2005-11-02 20:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834594, 250624, 46467, '<td valign="top">I love the backlight and how it illuminates in contrast to the vibrant blues and green.  This is a photo worthy of a frame and looked at many times because you''re almost sure that a bird changed position.   Great shot!!</td>', 'I love the backlight and how it illuminates in contrast to the vibrant blues and green.  This is a photo worthy of a frame and looked at many times because you''re almost sure that a bird changed position.   Great shot!!', '2005-11-02 20:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834597, 251363, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Love the colors!  Moving cars don''t distract from the image at all, in fact they add more color - very nice.</td>', 'Very cool!  Love the colors!  Moving cars don''t distract from the image at all, in fact they add more color - very nice.', '2005-11-02 20:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834598, 250428, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Great capture.  The greenish color tone distracts from the image though.</td>', 'Very cool!  Great capture.  The greenish color tone distracts from the image though.', '2005-11-02 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834604, 252167, 46467, '<td valign="top">Wow!!  I keep returning to inspect this!!  A grand and unique idea/shot for this category.</td>', 'Wow!!  I keep returning to inspect this!!  A grand and unique idea/shot for this category.', '2005-11-02 20:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834605, 252281, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  Not enough movement for me though.  It''s in between stop action and using slow shutter to show movement.  Would have liked to see it more one way or the other (for this challenge).</td>', 'Nice picture.  Not enough movement for me though.  It''s in between stop action and using slow shutter to show movement.  Would have liked to see it more one way or the other (for this challenge).', '2005-11-02 20:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834608, 250555, 40019, '<td valign="top">Definitely shows motion, but not sure the subject material will compete well in this crowd.</td>', 'Definitely shows motion, but not sure the subject material will compete well in this crowd.', '2005-11-02 20:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834609, 250590, 46467, '<td valign="top">How did you do that????  Pretty neat!!</td>', 'How did you do that????  Pretty neat!!', '2005-11-02 20:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834610, 252308, 19944, '<td valign="top">I don''t see where "shutter speed leads to the main impact" in this photo.</td>', 'I don''t see where "shutter speed leads to the main impact" in this photo.', '2005-11-02 20:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834618, 252034, 40019, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture!  Definitely slow shutter speed is capturing the imagery.  But there''s nothing in real motion, or stop motion to high-light the use of shutter speed (unless I am totally missing it - but I''m looking real close to find something). :-)</td>', 'Beautiful picture!  Definitely slow shutter speed is capturing the imagery.  But there''s nothing in real motion, or stop motion to high-light the use of shutter speed (unless I am totally missing it - but I''m looking real close to find something). :-)', '2005-11-02 20:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834622, 250622, 40019, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  What he actually jumping rope, or just using a stiff rope for the image. In either case, nice picture, great title.</td>', 'Very cool!  What he actually jumping rope, or just using a stiff rope for the image. In either case, nice picture, great title.', '2005-11-02 20:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834627, 251600, 40019, '<td valign="top">Love the rich colors. Nice capture.</td>', 'Love the rich colors. Nice capture.', '2005-11-02 20:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834630, 251838, 19944, '<td valign="top">Stunning, absolutely stunning.</td>', 'Stunning, absolutely stunning.', '2005-11-02 20:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834632, 252396, 46467, '<td valign="top">I''m always attracted to anything labeled "Halloween."   Nice mix of movement.</td>', 'I''m always attracted to anything labeled "Halloween."   Nice mix of movement.', '2005-11-02 20:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834633, 250789, 40019, '<td valign="top">Cool pic.  You know the ends of the beaters were going to be blurry, so I would have tried to get the stems in sharper focus.  Would have made for a more dramatic image (IMO).</td>', 'Cool pic.  You know the ends of the beaters were going to be blurry, so I would have tried to get the stems in sharper focus.  Would have made for a more dramatic image (IMO).', '2005-11-02 20:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834643, 251703, 46467, '<td valign="top">Hee-hee!!!  I''m giggling!  Adorable!  Great shot!</td>', 'Hee-hee!!!  I''m giggling!  Adorable!  Great shot!', '2005-11-02 20:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834666, 251965, 45857, '<td valign="top">Dramatic shot. Nice to see that the tree stood still for you. The touch of red makes it very interesting</td>', 'Dramatic shot. Nice to see that the tree stood still for you. The touch of red makes it very interesting', '2005-11-02 20:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834686, 252447, 45857, '<td valign="top">Very creative shot.</td>', 'Very creative shot.', '2005-11-02 20:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834694, 252275, 45857, '<td valign="top">Not sure how it shot depicts motion, if the car is moving down the road there''s nothing that shows it off.</td>', 'Not sure how it shot depicts motion, if the car is moving down the road there''s nothing that shows it off.', '2005-11-02 21:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834704, 251800, 45857, '<td valign="top">Love the vivid colors, unfortunate about the other photographer</td>', 'Love the vivid colors, unfortunate about the other photographer', '2005-11-02 21:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834717, 252496, 36006, '<td valign="top">HUH?<br/>I know what you were after, but part of this shutter speed challenge is to have some crispness, at least, a the very least in your subjects eyes, or face or whateveryour subject matter is.Anyone can make a blur, not everyone can make a crisp picture that shows movement, or captures the movement.  This is WAY too blurry. Try to take more than one pix next time and experiment with your shutter. <br/> <br/>I don''t see anything that resembles glass, all I see is some big blur. I looked at your profile and know you could of done better.</td>', 'HUH?I know what you were after, but part of this shutter speed challenge is to have some crispness, at least, a the very least in your subjects eyes, or face or whateveryour subject matter is.Anyone can make a blur, not everyone can make a crisp picture that shows movement, or captures the movement.  This is WAY too blurry. Try to take more than one pix next time and experiment with your shutter.  I don''t see anything that resembles glass, all I see is some big blur. I looked at your profile and know you could of done better.', '2005-11-02 21:14:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1834721, 251800, 36006, '<td valign="top">I know what you were after, but part of this shutter speed challenge is to have some crispness, at least, athe very least in your subjects eyes, or face. This is WAY too blurry. Try to take more than one pix next time and experiment with your shutter. <br/> <br/>color way too satureated, crop needs work, where are the emotions that sport demands,black ok whites blown out, soft on focus, can''t see the lighting well</td>', 'I know what you were after, but part of this shutter speed challenge is to have some crispness, at least, athe very least in your subjects eyes, or face. This is WAY too blurry. Try to take more than one pix next time and experiment with your shutter.  color way too satureated, crop needs work, where are the emotions that sport demands,black ok whites blown out, soft on focus, can''t see the lighting well', '2005-11-02 21:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834722, 251363, 15212, '<td valign="top">I like all the different colors here!<br/>I think I would like it better with a longer shutter speed to get the cars going all the down the street</td>', 'I like all the different colors here!I think I would like it better with a longer shutter speed to get the cars going all the down the street', '2005-11-02 21:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834724, 251775, 39664, '<td valign="top">Outcast? Why because she is the only one moving?  I think this photo could be so much more.  The position of the people is great composition and gives the photo some depth but it still is a bit snapshotish.</td>', 'Outcast? Why because she is the only one moving?  I think this photo could be so much more.  The position of the people is great composition and gives the photo some depth but it still is a bit snapshotish.', '2005-11-02 21:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834725, 252100, 36006, '<td valign="top">I know what you were after, but part of this shutter speed challenge is to have some crispness, at least, athe very least in your subjects eyes, or face, or whatever you subject matter is. This is WAY too blurry. Try to take more than one pix next time and experiment with your shutter. <br/> <br/>Undistinguishable, not even abstract, the only thing I can say is that you have some nice colors peeking out.</td>', 'I know what you were after, but part of this shutter speed challenge is to have some crispness, at least, athe very least in your subjects eyes, or face, or whatever you subject matter is. This is WAY too blurry. Try to take more than one pix next time and experiment with your shutter.  Undistinguishable, not even abstract, the only thing I can say is that you have some nice colors peeking out.', '2005-11-02 21:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834728, 250521, 39664, '<td valign="top">Good stop action shot.  I don''t care for the angle tho.  It would have been nice to have maybe been behind him, getting only the boy, the axe and the target, rather than all the distracting background (which appears tilted also)</td>', 'Good stop action shot.  I don''t care for the angle tho.  It would have been nice to have maybe been behind him, getting only the boy, the axe and the target, rather than all the distracting background (which appears tilted also)', '2005-11-02 21:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834729, 251856, 36006, '<td valign="top">I know what you were after, but part of this shutter speed challenge is to have some crispness, at least, athe very least in your subjects eyes, or face. This is WAY too blurry. Try to take more than one pix next time and experiment with your shutter. <br/> <br/>color ok, a bit bright, blacks good, whites need work, texture ok, comp needs work,lighting can''t tell</td>', 'I know what you were after, but part of this shutter speed challenge is to have some crispness, at least, athe very least in your subjects eyes, or face. This is WAY too blurry. Try to take more than one pix next time and experiment with your shutter.  color ok, a bit bright, blacks good, whites need work, texture ok, comp needs work,lighting can''t tell', '2005-11-02 21:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834730, 251698, 39057, '<td valign="top">Very nice...maybe just a little more exposure on the moving bird''s face...I like the static bird in the water. He holds the picture together and gives the moving bird "more life" IMO. 7</td>', 'Very nice...maybe just a little more exposure on the moving bird''s face...I like the static bird in the water. He holds the picture together and gives the moving bird "more life" IMO. 7', '2005-11-02 21:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834734, 252491, 39664, '<td valign="top">Looks like a lite brite or spirograph design.  Love the exactness of the distance between the lines and the intersection.  Nice work!</td>', 'Looks like a lite brite or spirograph design.  Love the exactness of the distance between the lines and the intersection.  Nice work!', '2005-11-02 21:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834735, 251432, 36006, '<td valign="top">I know what you were after, but part of this shutter speed challenge is to have some crispness, at least, athe very least in your subjects eyes, or face, or some peice of your subject. This is WAY too blurry. Try to take more than one pix next time and experiment with your shutter. <br/> <br/>nice red, comp needs work, blacks not there, whites not there, lighting??, texture??</td>', 'I know what you were after, but part of this shutter speed challenge is to have some crispness, at least, athe very least in your subjects eyes, or face, or some peice of your subject. This is WAY too blurry. Try to take more than one pix next time and experiment with your shutter.  nice red, comp needs work, blacks not there, whites not there, lighting??, texture??', '2005-11-02 21:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834737, 252275, 15212, '<td valign="top">Nice fall colors, but I don''t see how the shutter speed effects this much. It looks like it could have been taken at 1/30 or 3".</td>', 'Nice fall colors, but I don''t see how the shutter speed effects this much. It looks like it could have been taken at 1/30 or 3".', '2005-11-02 21:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834740, 250072, 39057, '<td valign="top">I like it. I only wish the "contrast" between the animals and the background was better. Not "curve" wise but color wise.</td>', 'I like it. I only wish the "contrast" between the animals and the background was better. Not "curve" wise but color wise.', '2005-11-02 21:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834741, 251838, 39057, '<td valign="top">Nice setup...maybe a tad overexposed.</td>', 'Nice setup...maybe a tad overexposed.', '2005-11-02 21:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834742, 252356, 39057, '<td valign="top">Tighter crop would have made this pretty good.</td>', 'Tighter crop would have made this pretty good.', '2005-11-02 21:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834743, 252093, 15212, '<td valign="top">The flash lighting is pretty harsh, composition seems odd to me.</td>', 'The flash lighting is pretty harsh, composition seems odd to me.', '2005-11-02 21:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834745, 252449, 39057, '<td valign="top">Since I can''t see any hint of a flash, I''m going to assume this was taken at a slow shutter speed. Below 50 perhaps. Colors are nice. Right side of face may be a tad blurry.</td>', 'Since I can''t see any hint of a flash, I''m going to assume this was taken at a slow shutter speed. Below 50 perhaps. Colors are nice. Right side of face may be a tad blurry.', '2005-11-02 21:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834749, 250624, 39057, '<td valign="top">Nice..but don''t you hate that slow shutter speeds lends itsef to overexposure?...</td>', 'Nice..but don''t you hate that slow shutter speeds lends itsef to overexposure?...', '2005-11-02 21:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834754, 250072, 15212, '<td valign="top">I love the stopped action, I just wish they didn''t blend into the background so much.</td>', 'I love the stopped action, I just wish they didn''t blend into the background so much.', '2005-11-02 21:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1834758, 250353, 39057, '<td valign="top">Nice but like my shots....a little blurry!</td>', 'Nice but like my shots....a little blurry!', '2005-11-02 21:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
