(1836428, 251450, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good shot.  Criticism; not much, maybe the yellow line in the background slightly detracts, but I do like the ''green'', and the overall background ''effect'', adds to the shot.  Good ''capture''.</td>', '7 - Good shot.  Criticism; not much, maybe the yellow line in the background slightly detracts, but I do like the ''green'', and the overall background ''effect'', adds to the shot.  Good ''capture''.', '2005-11-03 17:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836438, 252167, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good shot.  Criticism; even sharper, more ''depth'' (both difficult to attain I imagine), making the ''suspension'' really ''pop out'' and the colors more vivid would make this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a different crop, not sure.</td>', '7 - Good shot.  Criticism; even sharper, more ''depth'' (both difficult to attain I imagine), making the ''suspension'' really ''pop out'' and the colors more vivid would make this even better in my opinion.  Perhaps a different crop, not sure.', '2005-11-03 18:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
