(1836480, 250993, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Criticism; not sure how, but would really like to see definition in that whirlpool, or perhaps even the focus on it (looks like it is ''above'' but apologies if wrong).  Very nice coloring and texture.  Maybe more ''fore crop'', not sure.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Criticism; not sure how, but would really like to see definition in that whirlpool, or perhaps even the focus on it (looks like it is ''above'' but apologies if wrong).  Very nice coloring and texture.  Maybe more ''fore crop'', not sure.', '2005-11-03 18:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836489, 251932, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good shot.  Criticism; ''if only'' the engine/etc were not blurred, but I realize it was ''rumbling'', so maybe (if possible) to work with what you had, a tighter crop on the driver and wheels, even (again dependent) showing more ''smoke'' at the rear, not sure.</td>', '7 - Good shot.  Criticism; ''if only'' the engine/etc were not blurred, but I realize it was ''rumbling'', so maybe (if possible) to work with what you had, a tighter crop on the driver and wheels, even (again dependent) showing more ''smoke'' at the rear, not sure.', '2005-11-03 18:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836496, 250624, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good shot and nice colors and background.  Criticism; obviously difficult, but sharper on at least a couple of the birds, or the focal point different maybe, not sure.  No expert in ''shutter speed''.  Good potential here though.</td>', '6 - Good shot and nice colors and background.  Criticism; obviously difficult, but sharper on at least a couple of the birds, or the focal point different maybe, not sure.  No expert in ''shutter speed''.  Good potential here though.', '2005-11-03 18:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836499, 252144, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good span capture.  Criticism; dependent of course on what you had to work with, but a tighter crop.  Perhaps a different ''composition'', somehow, not sure.  Good ''under'' view.</td>', '6 - Good span capture.  Criticism; dependent of course on what you had to work with, but a tighter crop.  Perhaps a different ''composition'', somehow, not sure.  Good ''under'' view.', '2005-11-03 18:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836518, 252320, 42198, '<td valign="top">Looks like the coin on the right is defying the laws of physics! - Nice shot though, imaginative.</td>', 'Looks like the coin on the right is defying the laws of physics! - Nice shot though, imaginative.', '2005-11-03 18:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836520, 251860, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Wish this were bigger (but I know you''ve gone as wide as you can).  Criticism; not sure but seems to me it needs a slight nudge up on the right.  Perhaps ''bigger'' (although I realize you''d lose the effect), incorporating some of the good fall colors in the background, may have made this better (albeit different) in my opinion.  Perhaps even a tighter crop at the fore, emphasizing the ''flows''.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Wish this were bigger (but I know you''ve gone as wide as you can).  Criticism; not sure but seems to me it needs a slight nudge up on the right.  Perhaps ''bigger'' (although I realize you''d lose the effect), incorporating some of the good fall colors in the background, may have made this better (albeit different) in my opinion.  Perhaps even a tighter crop at the fore, emphasizing the ''flows''.', '2005-11-03 18:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836525, 250541, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good.  Criticism; difficult but, would like to have seen it sharper on the face.  Perhaps a horizontal rather than vertical crop, not sure.</td>', '6 - Good.  Criticism; difficult but, would like to have seen it sharper on the face.  Perhaps a horizontal rather than vertical crop, not sure.', '2005-11-03 18:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836530, 252426, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good idea/concept, if original then well done.  Criticism; obviously more definition in the strings.  I like the crop and angle, perhaps slightly different lighting, seems a little ''yellow'', but maybe that''s what you were going for.</td>', '6 - Good idea/concept, if original then well done.  Criticism; obviously more definition in the strings.  I like the crop and angle, perhaps slightly different lighting, seems a little ''yellow'', but maybe that''s what you were going for.', '2005-11-03 18:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836534, 252332, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice colors.  Criticism; needs straightening/symmetry.  Like to see the colors even bolder, more vivid.</td>', '6 - Nice colors.  Criticism; needs straightening/symmetry.  Like to see the colors even bolder, more vivid.', '2005-11-03 18:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836542, 251294, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good shot.  Criticism; depending how many shots you got, the hands ''detract'' from this shot in my opinion.  The b/w works well, but perhaps some more contrast (but difficult with the clothing I imagine).  I also want to say ''sharper'' on the girl, but the soft effect is also nice.</td>', '7 - Good shot.  Criticism; depending how many shots you got, the hands ''detract'' from this shot in my opinion.  The b/w works well, but perhaps some more contrast (but difficult with the clothing I imagine).  I also want to say ''sharper'' on the girl, but the soft effect is also nice.', '2005-11-03 18:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836547, 251800, 42198, '<td valign="top">Quite a dynamic image. However, I think you''ve really overdone the processing here - much too saturated causing any detail to be overwhelmed by colour.</td>', 'Quite a dynamic image. However, I think you''ve really overdone the processing here - much too saturated causing any detail to be overwhelmed by colour.', '2005-11-03 18:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
