(1836621, 251961, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very nice.  Criticism; if it were either not so dark or the ''blues'' more vivid, make this better in my opinion, but perhaps you were going for this ''darkness''.</td>', '7 - Very nice.  Criticism; if it were either not so dark or the ''blues'' more vivid, make this better in my opinion, but perhaps you were going for this ''darkness''.', '2005-11-03 19:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
