(1836644, 252167, 19944, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 9.  Would have been a 10, but the stick and the balloon are sort of distracting.  Don''t ask me how to get the shot without them, though.</td>', 'I gave it a 9.  Would have been a 10, but the stick and the balloon are sort of distracting.  Don''t ask me how to get the shot without them, though.', '2005-11-03 19:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
