(1836923, 252337, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good idea and potential.  Criticism; difficult as am no expert in shutter speed, but seems to me the focal point is ''off'', not sure.  Perhaps a different clock face, different crop, angle, may have helped this in my opinion.</td>', '5 - Good idea and potential.  Criticism; difficult as am no expert in shutter speed, but seems to me the focal point is ''off'', not sure.  Perhaps a different clock face, different crop, angle, may have helped this in my opinion.', '2005-11-03 21:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
