(1836973, 252204, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very good.  Criticism; difficult I imagine, but ''if only'' the dash were not blurred, perhaps, not sure, as it does add a little something here.   Perhaps a tighter crop on the right, excluding the tacometer, etc and just with the purples, not sure.  Would look great ''wider'' (but I know the restrictions).</td>', '7 - Very good.  Criticism; difficult I imagine, but ''if only'' the dash were not blurred, perhaps, not sure, as it does add a little something here.   Perhaps a tighter crop on the right, excluding the tacometer, etc and just with the purples, not sure.  Would look great ''wider'' (but I know the restrictions).', '2005-11-03 22:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1836975, 249715, 41574, '<td valign="top">The focus seems slightly off, but it''s still a nice shot.</td>', 'The focus seems slightly off, but it''s still a nice shot.', '2005-11-03 22:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
