(1843210, 250979, 45857, '<td valign="top">Sehr gut..</td>', 'Sehr gut..', '2005-11-06 22:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843272, 252470, 46056, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Is it a double exposure?  How did you get the lights in the sky?  Nice.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Is it a double exposure?  How did you get the lights in the sky?  Nice.', '2005-11-06 23:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843277, 252172, 46056, '<td valign="top">The horse looks great!  I think (given the choice) I would have preferred to have only the lady in black in the shot leading the horse (and not the second lady in the background).  Still an enjoyable shot - you can feel the energy in the horse''s jump.</td>', 'The horse looks great!  I think (given the choice) I would have preferred to have only the lady in black in the shot leading the horse (and not the second lady in the background).  Still an enjoyable shot - you can feel the energy in the horse''s jump.', '2005-11-06 23:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843284, 252180, 46056, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see a little more detail in the duck''s head.  I like the flapping wings, though.  I also like the choice of black and white.</td>', 'I would have liked to see a little more detail in the duck''s head.  I like the flapping wings, though.  I also like the choice of black and white.', '2005-11-06 23:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843305, 252208, 46056, '<td valign="top">I appreciate what you were going for with this shot.  I''m sure you didn''t have the opportunity to shoot many frames of this magnificent creature in motion, so please take my comments with a pinch of salt.  For my taste, there is a little TOO much motion - I would have liked to see more of the cat in sharper focus and maybe just his legs moving - in other words a slightly faster shutter speed.  Good shot, nonetheless.</td>', 'I appreciate what you were going for with this shot.  I''m sure you didn''t have the opportunity to shoot many frames of this magnificent creature in motion, so please take my comments with a pinch of salt.  For my taste, there is a little TOO much motion - I would have liked to see more of the cat in sharper focus and maybe just his legs moving - in other words a slightly faster shutter speed.  Good shot, nonetheless.', '2005-11-06 23:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843307, 252485, 45857, '<td valign="top">Good image, I wonder about the effect of WB, tungsten yellow seems a bit distracting. (Actually better than i first thought)</td>', 'Good image, I wonder about the effect of WB, tungsten yellow seems a bit distracting. (Actually better than i first thought)', '2005-11-06 23:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843311, 250574, 46056, '<td valign="top">I''m not normally a fan of ''overly blurred'' pictures but this shot has an attractive abstract/artistic feel to it - well done! =;-)</td>', 'I''m not normally a fan of ''overly blurred'' pictures but this shot has an attractive abstract/artistic feel to it - well done! =;-)', '2005-11-06 23:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843315, 252340, 46056, '<td valign="top">The water looks amazing (I wish I could take 8 second exposures =;-) ).  Well done.</td>', 'The water looks amazing (I wish I could take 8 second exposures =;-) ).  Well done.', '2005-11-06 23:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843317, 252398, 46056, '<td valign="top">A sweet shot.</td>', 'A sweet shot.', '2005-11-06 23:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843324, 251933, 46056, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see some detail in the front of the truck but I like the choice of subject.</td>', 'I would have liked to see some detail in the front of the truck but I like the choice of subject.', '2005-11-06 23:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843335, 252435, 31738, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2005-11-06 23:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843337, 251036, 46056, '<td valign="top">Admirably candid.  I might have cropped the top a little more to eliminate the yellow ribbon.  The bunting makes the shot interesting.  Good job!</td>', 'Admirably candid.  I might have cropped the top a little more to eliminate the yellow ribbon.  The bunting makes the shot interesting.  Good job!', '2005-11-06 23:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
