(1843354, 252167, 46056, '<td valign="top">Great idea and a very fast shutter speed I would have thought.  Perhaps the crop could have been a little less tight at the top and bottom?  Nice shot.</td>', 'Great idea and a very fast shutter speed I would have thought.  Perhaps the crop could have been a little less tight at the top and bottom?  Nice shot.', '2005-11-06 23:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843357, 251957, 45857, '<td valign="top">I hate to be hard ass, but to me the hand in and out of the frame just doesn''t meet the motion aspect of the challenge.</td>', 'I hate to be hard ass, but to me the hand in and out of the frame just doesn''t meet the motion aspect of the challenge.', '2005-11-06 23:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843364, 250353, 46056, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the placement of the subject.  It is a shame the sky is so ''bare''.  A few clouds might have (for once) been a good thing.  I get the feeling this is a (well-chosen) section of a larger picture - I am not sure whether the bird is a little out of focus or whether resizing has caused an unfortunate grainy feel.</td>', 'I enjoy the placement of the subject.  It is a shame the sky is so ''bare''.  A few clouds might have (for once) been a good thing.  I get the feeling this is a (well-chosen) section of a larger picture - I am not sure whether the bird is a little out of focus or whether resizing has caused an unfortunate grainy feel.', '2005-11-06 23:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843377, 251703, 46056, '<td valign="top">This photo really did make me smile so I think your title is certainly apt.  There is a real engagement in the children''s eyes - they sparkle.  The tones in their skin are beautiful.  I''m not sure about the wild character in the corner but it does explain the cheeky giggles.  Overall - lovely.</td>', 'This photo really did make me smile so I think your title is certainly apt.  There is a real engagement in the children''s eyes - they sparkle.  The tones in their skin are beautiful.  I''m not sure about the wild character in the corner but it does explain the cheeky giggles.  Overall - lovely.', '2005-11-06 23:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843380, 250952, 46056, '<td valign="top">I would like to know how you get this effect with the lights on the ferris wheel?</td>', 'I would like to know how you get this effect with the lights on the ferris wheel?', '2005-11-06 23:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843381, 251055, 47356, '<td valign="top">I like the calming effect of this photo, but my eye keeps wanting to climb just a little higher to see a little more of the top of the falls. The appearance of the water is almost like milk. A great shot.</td>', 'I like the calming effect of this photo, but my eye keeps wanting to climb just a little higher to see a little more of the top of the falls. The appearance of the water is almost like milk. A great shot.', '2005-11-06 23:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843383, 252055, 46056, '<td valign="top">Cool =;-)  It is a shame the crop is so tight at the top but definitely a cool shot.</td>', 'Cool =;-)  It is a shame the crop is so tight at the top but definitely a cool shot.', '2005-11-06 23:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843396, 250428, 45857, '<td valign="top">Exciting photo, really feel the energy. The green cast hurts it for me.</td>', 'Exciting photo, really feel the energy. The green cast hurts it for me.', '2005-11-06 23:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843403, 252332, 46056, '<td valign="top">The colours in this shot are amazing as is the symmetry =;-)</td>', 'The colours in this shot are amazing as is the symmetry =;-)', '2005-11-06 23:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843420, 252347, 46056, '<td valign="top">I like the confident choice of angle of the lampost.</td>', 'I like the confident choice of angle of the lampost.', '2005-11-06 23:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843426, 252475, 46056, '<td valign="top">The colours are a little washed out for me, sorry.</td>', 'The colours are a little washed out for me, sorry.', '2005-11-06 23:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843435, 252453, 47356, '<td valign="top">Great photo of the hallway, and the characters help add something to it, but I find it a little disturbing that I cannot see their shape a little more defined. My thoughts only.</td>', 'Great photo of the hallway, and the characters help add something to it, but I find it a little disturbing that I cannot see their shape a little more defined. My thoughts only.', '2005-11-06 23:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
