(1843451, 252329, 47356, '<td valign="top">The photo has a great impact on me. I like how the birds are heading in all directions. There appears to be something with the focus that makes it look like a photo that has been cropped or zoomed in with digital zoom - just not fully crisp. But I really like it.</td>', 'The photo has a great impact on me. I like how the birds are heading in all directions. There appears to be something with the focus that makes it look like a photo that has been cropped or zoomed in with digital zoom - just not fully crisp. But I really like it.', '2005-11-06 23:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843460, 251347, 47356, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. I like it for the colours and shapes, but there is not really a main focus for me... more just a main colour. It has a feeling like the paintings by Monet (or Manet, I can never get those two right).</td>', 'Interesting photo. I like it for the colours and shapes, but there is not really a main focus for me... more just a main colour. It has a feeling like the paintings by Monet (or Manet, I can never get those two right).', '2005-11-06 23:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843464, 252126, 47356, '<td valign="top">This is great. The light, shape, use of depth of field. I think it is a great entry for this category. Well done.</td>', 'This is great. The light, shape, use of depth of field. I think it is a great entry for this category. Well done.', '2005-11-06 23:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843474, 251384, 46056, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  For me, this photograph has the feel of Edgar Degas'' ''The Prima Ballerina''.  Ethereal.</td>', 'Pretty.  For me, this photograph has the feel of Edgar Degas'' ''The Prima Ballerina''.  Ethereal.', '2005-11-06 23:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843476, 251796, 47356, '<td valign="top">Getting those drops in such clear focus is great, but my attention is continually drawn to the Chinese man and they become a supporting theme. It is a very interesting photo though.</td>', 'Getting those drops in such clear focus is great, but my attention is continually drawn to the Chinese man and they become a supporting theme. It is a very interesting photo though.', '2005-11-06 23:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1843480, 252460, 46056, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the memories - this looks like the front of many of the physics textbooks from my undergraduate years =;-)</td>', 'Thanks for the memories - this looks like the front of many of the physics textbooks from my undergraduate years =;-)', '2005-11-06 23:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
