(1846379, 250043, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good colors and the photo definitely shows motion!  I might prefer is some part of the photo was more stationary, but as it is the blur gives a nice abstract feel to the photo.</td>', 'Good colors and the photo definitely shows motion!  I might prefer is some part of the photo was more stationary, but as it is the blur gives a nice abstract feel to the photo.', '2005-11-07 23:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846381, 252246, 29904, '<td valign="top">Nicely edgey!  wish I could see the shut lids better tho.<br/>Otherwise cool!</td>', 'Nicely edgey!  wish I could see the shut lids better tho.Otherwise cool!', '2005-11-07 23:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846385, 252496, 35513, '<td valign="top">You definitely show shutter speed in this photo, but it''s hard for me to tell what the subject is.  I think that if I could see the subject slightly better this photo would have more of an effect on me.  But I like the trails of white light that were left behind.</td>', 'You definitely show shutter speed in this photo, but it''s hard for me to tell what the subject is.  I think that if I could see the subject slightly better this photo would have more of an effect on me.  But I like the trails of white light that were left behind.', '2005-11-07 23:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846387, 252147, 29904, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot of fireworks, a delicate balance of long and quick exposure.</td>', 'Excellent shot of fireworks, a delicate balance of long and quick exposure.', '2005-11-07 23:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846393, 252148, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good show of shutter speed and I''m impressed that the motion blur is almost completely circular.  It has nice colors to it, but the subject of the shot gets a little lost in all that movement.</td>', 'Good show of shutter speed and I''m impressed that the motion blur is almost completely circular.  It has nice colors to it, but the subject of the shot gets a little lost in all that movement.', '2005-11-07 23:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
