(1846403, 252149, 29904, '<td valign="top">Lovely halo and arc.<br/>A little over exposed in center.  If possible close down shutter next time. <br/>nice contrast, minimalistic composition, and capture!</td>', 'Lovely halo and arc.A little over exposed in center.  If possible close down shutter next time. nice contrast, minimalistic composition, and capture!', '2005-11-07 23:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846408, 251996, 35513, '<td valign="top">A good action shot with lots of colors.  I might have cropped it so it showed a little more of the players (where the shutter speed is the subject) and a little off of the crowd.  But good clarity and lighting.</td>', 'A good action shot with lots of colors.  I might have cropped it so it showed a little more of the players (where the shutter speed is the subject) and a little off of the crowd.  But good clarity and lighting.', '2005-11-07 23:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846415, 252332, 35513, '<td valign="top">REALLY cool colors and neat composition.  I''ve seen the Eye in photos before, but not from this perspective, and I like that.  The blue in the trees looks really cool.</td>', 'REALLY cool colors and neat composition.  I''ve seen the Eye in photos before, but not from this perspective, and I like that.  The blue in the trees looks really cool.', '2005-11-07 23:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846423, 252100, 35513, '<td valign="top">Your subject has given some interesting colors, but it''s a relatively small portion of the photo.  This pic definitely shows shutter speed, but I think it gets a bit lost in the rest of the blank space.</td>', 'Your subject has given some interesting colors, but it''s a relatively small portion of the photo.  This pic definitely shows shutter speed, but I think it gets a bit lost in the rest of the blank space.', '2005-11-07 23:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846426, 252237, 35513, '<td valign="top">Really great creativity on this shot.  It shows shutter speed really well!  The B&amp;W definitely works for this image and the lighting shows facial detail very well.</td>', 'Really great creativity on this shot.  It shows shutter speed really well!  The B&W definitely works for this image and the lighting shows facial detail very well.', '2005-11-07 23:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846431, 252500, 35513, '<td valign="top">Awww :-)  Nice colors and motion on the water.  Very cute picture and the lighting really makes the shot.</td>', 'Awww :-)  Nice colors and motion on the water.  Very cute picture and the lighting really makes the shot.', '2005-11-07 23:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846435, 251699, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot with a good angle.  I like the filter, but I think I might like it a little more if applied at about 50%.  Nice work with some fast fingers to get that shot!</td>', 'Interesting shot with a good angle.  I like the filter, but I think I might like it a little more if applied at about 50%.  Nice work with some fast fingers to get that shot!', '2005-11-07 23:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
