(1846616, 251286, 43088, '<td valign="top">A perfectly timed shot! It is interesting that the windows he is passing are shut while the third at least has the shutters open. I would guess he is an acrobat. Rule one of a great photo- choose your background and you chose well. I would venture to guess that it is cropped but not a lot from the original.  Lighting and timing are spot on as well!</td>', 'A perfectly timed shot! It is interesting that the windows he is passing are shut while the third at least has the shutters open. I would guess he is an acrobat. Rule one of a great photo- choose your background and you chose well. I would venture to guess that it is cropped but not a lot from the original.  Lighting and timing are spot on as well!', '2005-11-08 02:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846619, 250735, 43088, '<td valign="top">I have troubles seeing how it fits the theme.  It is mysterious and eerie.</td>', 'I have troubles seeing how it fits the theme.  It is mysterious and eerie.', '2005-11-08 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
