(1846625, 251174, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice low angle for the shot but I do not care for the cropping on the car. Perhaps leaving more on both sides of the picture would have helped.</td>', 'Nice low angle for the shot but I do not care for the cropping on the car. Perhaps leaving more on both sides of the picture would have helped.', '2005-11-08 02:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
