(1846685, 250812, 43088, '<td valign="top">It''s the Mummy!  I really like this one.  The mistyness and their body language really add to it as well.  Not your typical football photo, but more interesting as a resi;t!  These guys are ready to rumble!  9</td>', 'It''s the Mummy!  I really like this one.  The mistyness and their body language really add to it as well.  Not your typical football photo, but more interesting as a resi;t!  These guys are ready to rumble!  9', '2005-11-08 03:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
