(1846789, 250788, 45857, '<td valign="top">Beautiful little water falls, nicely done</td>', 'Beautiful little water falls, nicely done', '2005-11-08 05:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846832, 252135, 44400, '<td valign="top">While I like this shot---I didn''t forget the beverage challenge photo that you more than likely got this idea from. I would like to think a photgrapher would use some better judgement with their creativity then using another''s. Good luck, the original photographer also had a great idea and it appears you have taken note of that fact.</td>', 'While I like this shot---I didn''t forget the beverage challenge photo that you more than likely got this idea from. I would like to think a photgrapher would use some better judgement with their creativity then using another''s. Good luck, the original photographer also had a great idea and it appears you have taken note of that fact.', '2005-11-08 06:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846836, 251961, 44400, '<td valign="top">This photo is really exceptional, makes you feel like you are standing there watching the night falls. I can hear the sounds of flowing water as it falls, I can hear the time it takes to whisp over the apparent bed of a river smooth rocks. I can feel the brisk night air and a bit of mist just looking at this. To do a photo like this at night is rare, most are taken during the daylight hours. Good idea, another great job, another challenge well done.</td>', 'This photo is really exceptional, makes you feel like you are standing there watching the night falls. I can hear the sounds of flowing water as it falls, I can hear the time it takes to whisp over the apparent bed of a river smooth rocks. I can feel the brisk night air and a bit of mist just looking at this. To do a photo like this at night is rare, most are taken during the daylight hours. Good idea, another great job, another challenge well done.', '2005-11-08 07:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846840, 252460, 44400, '<td valign="top">Wow, again I am writing to another photographer who has taken the creative idea of another, whom I might add received a top five for their job that was well done. I sorry to say that you capture the creativity, unfornately the photo lacks the intensity and stillness of the shutter speed. Good luck on this challenge.</td>', 'Wow, again I am writing to another photographer who has taken the creative idea of another, whom I might add received a top five for their job that was well done. I sorry to say that you capture the creativity, unfornately the photo lacks the intensity and stillness of the shutter speed. Good luck on this challenge.', '2005-11-08 07:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846908, 251632, 45961, '<td valign="top">This photo shows a lot of emotion; passion, strength, cravings and so much more. It''s quite good, but then I find something that I can''t point my finger at that''s not quite right about it.</td>', 'This photo shows a lot of emotion; passion, strength, cravings and so much more. It''s quite good, but then I find something that I can''t point my finger at that''s not quite right about it.', '2005-11-08 08:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846911, 251848, 45961, '<td valign="top">A beautiful scenery and good use of the slow shutter. The top of the picture focuses very well with speed, but as it get lower stream the beauty is beauty of the shutter speed is too slow. That''s what I believe at least. None the less, a fantastic picture, and I could probably never take a picture like that. I''m not that good.</td>', 'A beautiful scenery and good use of the slow shutter. The top of the picture focuses very well with speed, but as it get lower stream the beauty is beauty of the shutter speed is too slow. That''s what I believe at least. None the less, a fantastic picture, and I could probably never take a picture like that. I''m not that good.', '2005-11-08 08:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846915, 252465, 45961, '<td valign="top">The fast shutter speed was very well put into use. The free flow and the float during the gallop is great. It might have been a tid bit better if you manage to catch it when it''s evidently higher air and all four is up. I believe the hind limps are up in the air as well, but I''m not so sure.</td>', 'The fast shutter speed was very well put into use. The free flow and the float during the gallop is great. It might have been a tid bit better if you manage to catch it when it''s evidently higher air and all four is up. I believe the hind limps are up in the air as well, but I''m not so sure.', '2005-11-08 08:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846919, 250991, 45961, '<td valign="top">It''s a good picture, but I don''t see how the shutter speed would make an impact on this photo because it''s still.</td>', 'It''s a good picture, but I don''t see how the shutter speed would make an impact on this photo because it''s still.', '2005-11-08 08:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846923, 251318, 45961, '<td valign="top">Whoa, dangerous bicycle riding there. I can actually feel the motion and my head is starting to feel the pang of motion sickness. If the scene was more intense, I''m sure the results would have been stunning.</td>', 'Whoa, dangerous bicycle riding there. I can actually feel the motion and my head is starting to feel the pang of motion sickness. If the scene was more intense, I''m sure the results would have been stunning.', '2005-11-08 08:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846926, 249934, 45961, '<td valign="top">Fantastic picture, great contrast and colouration. Very well used on shutter speed and it fits the theme perfectly. Surreal is the word to describe it.</td>', 'Fantastic picture, great contrast and colouration. Very well used on shutter speed and it fits the theme perfectly. Surreal is the word to describe it.', '2005-11-08 08:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1846928, 251404, 45961, '<td valign="top">Well done on the panning. Hands and hats, pots and pans down to you! A very clear shot of the cyclist. Speed was definitely into play on this, unless you used motion blur on photoshop.</td>', 'Well done on the panning. Hands and hats, pots and pans down to you! A very clear shot of the cyclist. Speed was definitely into play on this, unless you used motion blur on photoshop.', '2005-11-08 08:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
