(1847181, 252033, 43400, '<td valign="top">Was this shot somewhere in New England?--the architecture looks very familiar--anyway, it has good potential but cannot see any shutter action and it''s a little blurred. I''d probably crop a little closer as well.</td>', 'Was this shot somewhere in New England?--the architecture looks very familiar--anyway, it has good potential but cannot see any shutter action and it''s a little blurred. I''d probably crop a little closer as well.', '2005-11-08 10:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
