(1847657, 251005, 37103, '<td valign="top">The water looks beautiful.  I love the shade of yellow.</td>', 'The water looks beautiful.  I love the shade of yellow.', '2005-11-08 14:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847659, 251716, 37103, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pink sky and I love the slow shutter speed and water.  It contrasts nicely with the dark craggy rock.</td>', 'Beautiful pink sky and I love the slow shutter speed and water.  It contrasts nicely with the dark craggy rock.', '2005-11-08 14:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847660, 252170, 37103, '<td valign="top">This is great.  It would be nice to see more of the girl in detail.  I know that would be hard to achieve becaues you need her movement to make the light circles.  Nice idea.</td>', 'This is great.  It would be nice to see more of the girl in detail.  I know that would be hard to achieve becaues you need her movement to make the light circles.  Nice idea.', '2005-11-08 15:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847661, 251860, 37103, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  You people who live near waterfalls were lucky for this challenge!  This looks gorgeous.  The only comment I can think to make is that it might have been nice to see some more of the trees at top.  It looks as though they are equally beautiful.</td>', 'Stunning.  You people who live near waterfalls were lucky for this challenge!  This looks gorgeous.  The only comment I can think to make is that it might have been nice to see some more of the trees at top.  It looks as though they are equally beautiful.', '2005-11-08 15:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847663, 252437, 37103, '<td valign="top">Nice non-traditional idea.   Very cool to see how something other than water looks in slow motion.  The image seems a little dark.</td>', 'Nice non-traditional idea.   Very cool to see how something other than water looks in slow motion.  The image seems a little dark.', '2005-11-08 15:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847680, 252383, 37103, '<td valign="top">Very creepy. I love her old fashioned dress.  Nice ghostly feel to it.</td>', 'Very creepy. I love her old fashioned dress.  Nice ghostly feel to it.', '2005-11-08 15:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847755, 251910, 29269, '<td valign="top">Other than being blurry, this will also suffer from voter saturation with the recent pumpkin challenge. And it is really blurry.</td>', 'Other than being blurry, this will also suffer from voter saturation with the recent pumpkin challenge. And it is really blurry.', '2005-11-08 15:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847759, 251945, 29269, '<td valign="top">This one seems to be out of focus, Good moment capture, good composition, nice choice for b&amp;w, but the image is too soft.</td>', 'This one seems to be out of focus, Good moment capture, good composition, nice choice for b&w, but the image is too soft.', '2005-11-08 15:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847765, 252504, 44924, '<td valign="top">That''s too funny, two independent minds thinking of practically the same thing for a challenge. I''m pretty sure I know who you are, cause you left me a comment about mine on the other challenge (Busy), so yes, let''s compare notes after the challenge is over. Great idea and execution, and oh, your model is prettier than mine. LOL</td>', 'That''s too funny, two independent minds thinking of practically the same thing for a challenge. I''m pretty sure I know who you are, cause you left me a comment about mine on the other challenge (Busy), so yes, let''s compare notes after the challenge is over. Great idea and execution, and oh, your model is prettier than mine. LOL', '2005-11-08 15:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847768, 252447, 29269, '<td valign="top">courageous or stupid... I''m not sure. <br/>Well, back to the photo: nice take on the trail of lights. Nice composition, but the lights of the incoming traffic are too bright. Perhaps either a smaller aperture (if not stopped to the max already) or lower ISO (if not lowest already) or a ND filter would have helped this. <br/>Please, do not re-shoot! (and do not take offense at the opening statement, but Darwin awards are full of stories like this one:)</td>', 'courageous or stupid... I''m not sure. Well, back to the photo: nice take on the trail of lights. Nice composition, but the lights of the incoming traffic are too bright. Perhaps either a smaller aperture (if not stopped to the max already) or lower ISO (if not lowest already) or a ND filter would have helped this. Please, do not re-shoot! (and do not take offense at the opening statement, but Darwin awards are full of stories like this one:)', '2005-11-08 15:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847774, 252150, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice stop motion, but for the splash photos to win, you have to put it in some context. If you look at the recent ribbon winner .)<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=249981" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/397/thumb/249981.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/397/thumb/249981.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/397/thumb/249981.jpg"/></a>, you''ll notice that there is more than just a drop of water in the bowl. There is an interesting background and the overall composition is much better there. You also have unwanted reflections (I imagine these are unwanted because they do not contribute to the photo at all, and if it does not help the photo, it ruins it<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-09 07:25:00.</i></td>', 'Nice stop motion, but for the splash photos to win, you have to put it in some context. If you look at the recent ribbon winner .), you''ll notice that there is more than just a drop of water in the bowl. There is an interesting background and the overall composition is much better there. You also have unwanted reflections (I imagine these are unwanted because they do not contribute to the photo at all, and if it does not help the photo, it ruins it', '2005-11-08 16:00:30.000000', '2005-11-09 07:25:00.000000', 1),
(1847775, 251450, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice catch and nice focusing! Would have been even better without that green splat in the background. You should attempt cleaning it up after the challenge since you did not have the freedom of advanced editing during the challenge.</td>', 'Nice catch and nice focusing! Would have been even better without that green splat in the background. You should attempt cleaning it up after the challenge since you did not have the freedom of advanced editing during the challenge.', '2005-11-08 16:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847778, 252488, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice! The water looks as if it is boiling. Although colors are nicely balanced, there is nothing that pops out in this photo. There is no main subject, my attention wanders from the boil (the most interesting area) to the green grass in the upper left (attracts attention but not really interesting) to the leaves in the upper right (could be more attractive but are in fact less appealing to the eye). Could be better...</td>', 'Nice! The water looks as if it is boiling. Although colors are nicely balanced, there is nothing that pops out in this photo. There is no main subject, my attention wanders from the boil (the most interesting area) to the green grass in the upper left (attracts attention but not really interesting) to the leaves in the upper right (could be more attractive but are in fact less appealing to the eye). Could be better...', '2005-11-08 16:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847779, 251961, 772, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... I love the cool tones in this one.. great work :)</td>', 'Beautiful... I love the cool tones in this one.. great work :)', '2005-11-08 16:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847781, 252384, 29269, '<td valign="top">Was the shadow on the right side desired, or something that was left behind? I think that you could have done without it, as it does not contribute to the photo (its position with respect to the main instance is unclear).</td>', 'Was the shadow on the right side desired, or something that was left behind? I think that you could have done without it, as it does not contribute to the photo (its position with respect to the main instance is unclear).', '2005-11-08 16:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847788, 252311, 29269, '<td valign="top">The size does not allow for proper evaluation of the photo. Can''t tell if it is blurry or just small.</td>', 'The size does not allow for proper evaluation of the photo. Can''t tell if it is blurry or just small.', '2005-11-08 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847803, 252337, 29269, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the second hand movement is not vividly displayed, and that should have been the focal point. This way I have to search for it and force the relationship to the challenge. It is there, but it is not the main point of the photo.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the second hand movement is not vividly displayed, and that should have been the focal point. This way I have to search for it and force the relationship to the challenge. It is there, but it is not the main point of the photo.', '2005-11-08 16:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847807, 251559, 29269, '<td valign="top">Cute! Perhaps, even more transparent little fella would have been better, and definitively a tighter crop. The alarm clock could be the rightmost item in the photo, and the bottom line should be where the scarf ends.</td>', 'Cute! Perhaps, even more transparent little fella would have been better, and definitively a tighter crop. The alarm clock could be the rightmost item in the photo, and the bottom line should be where the scarf ends.', '2005-11-08 16:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847815, 251661, 29269, '<td valign="top">Nice waterfall... however, the landscape orientation does not seem to be the best choice for this one. I understand that you wanted to avoid centered composition, but by leaving so much nothing to the left is not good either. You can experiment with portrait orientation, and leave out the whole left side, perhaps with the bottom of the waterfall in the lower-left 1/3rd point of the photo.</td>', 'Nice waterfall... however, the landscape orientation does not seem to be the best choice for this one. I understand that you wanted to avoid centered composition, but by leaving so much nothing to the left is not good either. You can experiment with portrait orientation, and leave out the whole left side, perhaps with the bottom of the waterfall in the lower-left 1/3rd point of the photo.', '2005-11-08 16:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847817, 252500, 29269, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, while ducks are beautiful subjects (in my opinion), they tend to ruin those images where they are in their most natural environment, since the nature gave them the ability to blend in. Good for ducks, bad for the photos of ducks.</td>', 'Unfortunately, while ducks are beautiful subjects (in my opinion), they tend to ruin those images where they are in their most natural environment, since the nature gave them the ability to blend in. Good for ducks, bad for the photos of ducks.', '2005-11-08 16:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847821, 250771, 29269, '<td valign="top">This could be the winner! Everything is there - the stop action, nice composition, clear photography, focus, interest, you have it all. Good luck!</td>', 'This could be the winner! Everything is there - the stop action, nice composition, clear photography, focus, interest, you have it all. Good luck!', '2005-11-08 16:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847824, 250590, 29269, '<td valign="top">The white balance seems to be off - the skin tones (on the kids especially) are too pale.A tighter crop (that would place these guys all in front of the wall, without the clutter on the right side) would have been much better.</td>', 'The white balance seems to be off - the skin tones (on the kids especially) are too pale.A tighter crop (that would place these guys all in front of the wall, without the clutter on the right side) would have been much better.', '2005-11-08 16:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847825, 252478, 29269, '<td valign="top">I actually expected some pool shots in the challenge, but nothing like this one... OK, not appealing to me.</td>', 'I actually expected some pool shots in the challenge, but nothing like this one... OK, not appealing to me.', '2005-11-08 16:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847829, 252501, 29269, '<td valign="top">I left a comment on another splashy photo telling them to put the splash in some kind of context, to make the imagery more interesting. You did the first part, but it is hardly interesting.</td>', 'I left a comment on another splashy photo telling them to put the splash in some kind of context, to make the imagery more interesting. You did the first part, but it is hardly interesting.', '2005-11-08 16:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847832, 252459, 24913, '<td valign="top">Nice Pic, but could definately do without the border.</td>', 'Nice Pic, but could definately do without the border.', '2005-11-08 16:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847834, 251961, 29269, '<td valign="top">Too dark, and with this amount of light you could have cropped the left side and a little from the right side leaving only the lighter portion(s) in the photo.</td>', 'Too dark, and with this amount of light you could have cropped the left side and a little from the right side leaving only the lighter portion(s) in the photo.', '2005-11-08 16:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847842, 252383, 46749, '<td valign="top">Awsome :) Good idea!!</td>', 'Awsome :) Good idea!!', '2005-11-08 16:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847843, 251703, 46749, '<td valign="top">Ha, this is a disturbing capture!! Everything so beautiful and cheerful and then bang, a half composed face pops up in the corner! Very nicely done! I''ll give this a 6 :)<br/> <br/>Benajmin</td>', 'Ha, this is a disturbing capture!! Everything so beautiful and cheerful and then bang, a half composed face pops up in the corner! Very nicely done! I''ll give this a 6 :) Benajmin', '2005-11-08 16:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847851, 252435, 46749, '<td valign="top">Although this is done so much, this would have been the perfect image if the car werent visible! I''ll give it a 5 regardless :)<br/> <br/>Benjamin</td>', 'Although this is done so much, this would have been the perfect image if the car werent visible! I''ll give it a 5 regardless :) Benjamin', '2005-11-08 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1847867, 252402, 24913, '<td valign="top">Beutiful shot. Too bad its got some noise in it.</td>', 'Beutiful shot. Too bad its got some noise in it.', '2005-11-08 17:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848021, 251842, 46056, '<td valign="top">A shame you can''t see the bird''s head.  The wingspan is beautiful, though.  Amazing how you forget quite how lovely ducks can look!  Great =;-)</td>', 'A shame you can''t see the bird''s head.  The wingspan is beautiful, though.  Amazing how you forget quite how lovely ducks can look!  Great =;-)', '2005-11-08 18:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848023, 251848, 46056, '<td valign="top">The quality of the water is stunning.  I shall check back after voting finishes to way up your shutter speed and other settings - I want to try to reproduce this myself.  See, inspirational!</td>', 'The quality of the water is stunning.  I shall check back after voting finishes to way up your shutter speed and other settings - I want to try to reproduce this myself.  See, inspirational!', '2005-11-08 18:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848027, 251838, 24642, '<td valign="top">Very good work.  I really like the color of the house against the almost black and white surroundings.  The composition and viewpoint work very well.</td>', 'Very good work.  I really like the color of the house against the almost black and white surroundings.  The composition and viewpoint work very well.', '2005-11-08 18:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848029, 250939, 46056, '<td valign="top">This is cropped rather too tight for me - what were you cutting out?  If your title didn''t say "horseback" I would never have known!  I like the choice of subject, though.</td>', 'This is cropped rather too tight for me - what were you cutting out?  If your title didn''t say "horseback" I would never have known!  I like the choice of subject, though.', '2005-11-08 18:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848031, 250521, 46056, '<td valign="top">Seems like a very dangerous sport to me?! =;-)</td>', 'Seems like a very dangerous sport to me?! =;-)', '2005-11-08 18:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848037, 251703, 24642, '<td valign="top">Giggle</td>', 'Giggle', '2005-11-08 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848042, 251294, 46056, '<td valign="top">I love the big smile on her face - really engaging!  I bet this was beautiful in full colour too.  I think I would have cropped this tighter - just below her elbows.  I find the necklace detracts a little from this as a timeless photo. Lovely autumnal portrait.</td>', 'I love the big smile on her face - really engaging!  I bet this was beautiful in full colour too.  I think I would have cropped this tighter - just below her elbows.  I find the necklace detracts a little from this as a timeless photo. Lovely autumnal portrait.', '2005-11-08 18:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848045, 251363, 46056, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.</td>', 'Nice concept.', '2005-11-08 18:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848047, 250622, 46056, '<td valign="top">The sunset is beautiful, of course.  It was actually the title that made me pause a little longer, though.  Cute.</td>', 'The sunset is beautiful, of course.  It was actually the title that made me pause a little longer, though.  Cute.', '2005-11-08 18:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
