(1848056, 252093, 46056, '<td valign="top">For me, the female model has movement and, even though she looks rather scared (as opposed to confident and athletic), I think her pose really works.  I''m not sure the male model is quite sure why he''s there, though.  I still gave you a good mark but I would definitely have rated it higher with just the one model.  Also, he throws off the illusion created by the angled shot.</td>', 'For me, the female model has movement and, even though she looks rather scared (as opposed to confident and athletic), I think her pose really works.  I''m not sure the male model is quite sure why he''s there, though.  I still gave you a good mark but I would definitely have rated it higher with just the one model.  Also, he throws off the illusion created by the angled shot.', '2005-11-08 18:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
