(1848870, 250624, 37893, '<td valign="top">WOW! Great capture. The feeding fenzy is beautifully captured and the slight blur of the wings enhance the motion. The background has a great contrast to it against the lighter colored birds :)</td>', 'WOW! Great capture. The feeding fenzy is beautifully captured and the slight blur of the wings enhance the motion. The background has a great contrast to it against the lighter colored birds :)', '2005-11-08 23:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848889, 252016, 37893, '<td valign="top">Never really saw Crissy Field like this so it''s quite refreshing. I love the quality of the colors that are reflecting against the water. Too bad for the bright spot at the left middle side. Maybe if this image was cropped a tad to rid of the shrub and that patch of green at the lower left hand corner, this would make it complete :) 7</td>', 'Never really saw Crissy Field like this so it''s quite refreshing. I love the quality of the colors that are reflecting against the water. Too bad for the bright spot at the left middle side. Maybe if this image was cropped a tad to rid of the shrub and that patch of green at the lower left hand corner, this would make it complete :) 7', '2005-11-08 23:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848890, 250931, 38706, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - Shame it''s not a red sports car huh, cause would ne a better picture :)</td>', 'Nice idea - Shame it''s not a red sports car huh, cause would ne a better picture :)', '2005-11-08 23:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1848897, 251699, 37893, '<td valign="top">This image seems a bit oversharpened but I do like the motion capture here. The fast shutter speed really freezed your subject in place. Good job.</td>', 'This image seems a bit oversharpened but I do like the motion capture here. The fast shutter speed really freezed your subject in place. Good job.', '2005-11-08 23:46:22.000000', NULL, 1);
