(1849666, 251182, 45197, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by srdanz:</b></div><hr/><i> Did any of that yolk end up on your lens? Congratulations on great capture of the moment. If only you could have picked a different angle, perhaps with more uniform background to increase the impact (pun intended). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah lots, Had to wipe it after every shot, but most of it got in my hair, naasty.</td>', 'Originally posted by srdanz: Did any of that yolk end up on your lens? Congratulations on great capture of the moment. If only you could have picked a different angle, perhaps with more uniform background to increase the impact (pun intended).   Yeah lots, Had to wipe it after every shot, but most of it got in my hair, naasty.', '2005-11-09 04:42:24.000000', NULL, 0),
