(1849801, 251174, 6202, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>First off your image is very nice.  The lighting is good the focus is good and your overall composition is goodalthough I would have liked to see the rear of the car.<br/> <br/>That being said you probably wonder why only 4.5  The challenge was shutter speed.  I''m sure you photographed this with a quick shutter while the average voter was looking for a photo done with a slower shutter where either the subject was in focus and the background a blur created by panning.  Or your subject a blur with the background in focus.   I feel your scroe was lower cause of how you interupted the challenge.<br/> <br/>I do hope to see more from you in the future.<br/> <br/>Anna</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club First off your image is very nice.  The lighting is good the focus is good and your overall composition is goodalthough I would have liked to see the rear of the car. That being said you probably wonder why only 4.5  The challenge was shutter speed.  I''m sure you photographed this with a quick shutter while the average voter was looking for a photo done with a slower shutter where either the subject was in focus and the background a blur created by panning.  Or your subject a blur with the background in focus.   I feel your scroe was lower cause of how you interupted the challenge. I do hope to see more from you in the future. Anna', '2005-11-09 06:45:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1849832, 250952, 16636, '<td valign="top">Just pipped you on this one Ian! Nice image, I see you are getting to grips quickly with your 20D!<br/>Neil.</td>', 'Just pipped you on this one Ian! Nice image, I see you are getting to grips quickly with your 20D!Neil.', '2005-11-09 07:05:56.000000', NULL, 0),
