(1850349, 251174, 45635, '<td valign="top">well i was dissapointed with my score but thats only because i didnt grasp the taste of what everyone liked i guess. I had tons of very nice pics from this photoshoot with panning and all. i just liked this one in particular, next time i''ll try to take photos to suit the needs everyone likes ;)<br/> <br/>perhaps a shot like this <br/> <br/><a href="//i3.photobucket.com/albums/y86/presidente1l/tws/DSC_2110.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//i3.photobucket.com/albums/y86/presidente1l/tws/th_DSC_2110.jpg'', strrpos(''//i3.photobucket.com/albums/y86/presidente1l/tws/th_DSC_2110.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//i3.photobucket.com/albums/y86/presidente1l/tws/th_DSC_2110.jpg"/></a> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-09 10:26:13.</i></td>', 'well i was dissapointed with my score but thats only because i didnt grasp the taste of what everyone liked i guess. I had tons of very nice pics from this photoshoot with panning and all. i just liked this one in particular, next time i''ll try to take photos to suit the needs everyone likes ;) perhaps a shot like this   ', '2005-11-09 10:23:10.000000', '2005-11-09 10:26:13.000000', 0),
