(1850893, 251987, 19708, '<td valign="top">This was one for me really.<br/>I really liked the grouping of the birds and then brought out the colors to give it a painted look.<br/>I guess I see something in this many/most don''t, and like this one a lot more than many/most of my ribbon pics.</td>', 'This was one for me really.I really liked the grouping of the birds and then brought out the colors to give it a painted look.I guess I see something in this many/most don''t, and like this one a lot more than many/most of my ribbon pics.', '2005-11-09 12:36:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(1851136, 251838, 21362, '<td valign="top">Really gorgeous. This definitely inspires me to try some flowing water shots, I love the effect here. Congratulations on your blue!</td>', 'Really gorgeous. This definitely inspires me to try some flowing water shots, I love the effect here. Congratulations on your blue!', '2005-11-09 13:37:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(1851246, 251856, 15922, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote/comment on this challenge, but I imagine there will have been lots of standard DPC ''perfectionist'' photos entered, so no doubt compared to these yours didn''t fit in.<br/> <br/>For me, if you take a bit of time to look at your image (admittedly not something I always do when voting), the motion blur really adds to the atmosphere, almost as if you can feel the ground shaking because of the strength of the bison. I quite like the processing you''ve done too - very bold especially if you''ve not done much editting before. I''m not so keen on the whiteness of the ground as I think it''s a bit distracting, buit maybe you couldn''t do much about this.<br/> <br/>As you said in the comments, it was never going to score particularly highly, but I''d be proud of this if I''d produced it.</td>', 'I didn''t vote/comment on this challenge, but I imagine there will have been lots of standard DPC ''perfectionist'' photos entered, so no doubt compared to these yours didn''t fit in. For me, if you take a bit of time to look at your image (admittedly not something I always do when voting), the motion blur really adds to the atmosphere, almost as if you can feel the ground shaking because of the strength of the bison. I quite like the processing you''ve done too - very bold especially if you''ve not done much editting before. I''m not so keen on the whiteness of the ground as I think it''s a bit distracting, buit maybe you couldn''t do much about this. As you said in the comments, it was never going to score particularly highly, but I''d be proud of this if I''d produced it.', '2005-11-09 14:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1851357, 252205, 42792, '<td valign="top">Really cool!  Love stark images like this.  Ditto about "this is gonna bomb but at least I''m taking more interesting shots" sentiment.</td>', 'Really cool!  Love stark images like this.  Ditto about "this is gonna bomb but at least I''m taking more interesting shots" sentiment.', '2005-11-09 14:31:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(1851561, 250352, 46819, '<td valign="top">Hey guys, thanks for all the positive comments btw. This was like my first picture I''ve ever taken properly with a digital camera. If you anted a brief explanation, I put two pieces of cardboard either side of the coins and then removed them in syncronisation with the timer on my camera. I do agree with you all about the background though, it is a bit dull and badly made what with the obvious gap between the wall and floor and the pieces of dust!</td>', 'Hey guys, thanks for all the positive comments btw. This was like my first picture I''ve ever taken properly with a digital camera. If you anted a brief explanation, I put two pieces of cardboard either side of the coins and then removed them in syncronisation with the timer on my camera. I do agree with you all about the background though, it is a bit dull and badly made what with the obvious gap between the wall and floor and the pieces of dust!', '2005-11-09 15:13:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(1851568, 252314, 25952, '<td valign="top">man u have your lighting set up pretty well, but yuck angle sorry man! Shoot a long lens 50 mm or more, if you can''t see really where the skater is coming from or landing that''s a bummer.<br/> <br/>Really check out  skateboardphotography.com   I swear it''ll help a lot.</td>', 'man u have your lighting set up pretty well, but yuck angle sorry man! Shoot a long lens 50 mm or more, if you can''t see really where the skater is coming from or landing that''s a bummer. Really check out  skateboardphotography.com   I swear it''ll help a lot.', '2005-11-09 15:15:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1851585, 251856, 42100, '<td valign="top">Eileen,  I thought this was great!  I would''ve scored it a little higher if the one bison wasn''t cutoff.  This used the challenge to portray something other than just motion.  <br/> <br/>These animal are strong and powerful, you definately showed the violence and the shaking of the earth tha occurs when these two beasts butt heads.  I also think that ghosting of the bison is a good metaphor for the spirituality of the bison to Native American lore.  Also doubles as a great metaphor for their dissapearance from the American plains.<br/> <br/>I wish I could capture that kind of meaning, and not just what''s in front of me, in my photos.  Well done and you definately undersold yourself in your comments.  <br/> <br/>Bison in France?  I never would of thought it.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-09 15:36:54.</i></td>', 'Eileen,  I thought this was great!  I would''ve scored it a little higher if the one bison wasn''t cutoff.  This used the challenge to portray something other than just motion.   These animal are strong and powerful, you definately showed the violence and the shaking of the earth tha occurs when these two beasts butt heads.  I also think that ghosting of the bison is a good metaphor for the spirituality of the bison to Native American lore.  Also doubles as a great metaphor for their dissapearance from the American plains. I wish I could capture that kind of meaning, and not just what''s in front of me, in my photos.  Well done and you definately undersold yourself in your comments.   Bison in France?  I never would of thought it.', '2005-11-09 15:20:53.000000', '2005-11-09 15:36:54.000000', 0),
(1851639, 252453, 36231, '<td valign="top">This is awesome! :)  Kind of like mine, where your background is clear and sharp, and the people are in motion.  I love the way the walls glow. It gives me the feel that ghosts are walking the hall. I love it!</td>', 'This is awesome! :)  Kind of like mine, where your background is clear and sharp, and the people are in motion.  I love the way the walls glow. It gives me the feel that ghosts are walking the hall. I love it!', '2005-11-09 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(1851722, 251987, 39038, '<td valign="top">the problem I see with this photo is the background. It is right at a spot that makes viewer an unpleasing dizzy feeling. either blurier or sharper should have made it a better image to my eyes. Idea is good though. I actually did some similar shots for this challenge too. At the end, I did not pick either of them. I got the same problem as you do, to make the birds sharper, I need a fair shutter speed, to make the background blurry enough to not make people dizzy, I need a slow speed. the cap is wide. unless...maybe...eagles? Just my 2 cents, you can ignore me, I never win a ribbon anyway.</td>', 'the problem I see with this photo is the background. It is right at a spot that makes viewer an unpleasing dizzy feeling. either blurier or sharper should have made it a better image to my eyes. Idea is good though. I actually did some similar shots for this challenge too. At the end, I did not pick either of them. I got the same problem as you do, to make the birds sharper, I need a fair shutter speed, to make the background blurry enough to not make people dizzy, I need a slow speed. the cap is wide. unless...maybe...eagles? Just my 2 cents, you can ignore me, I never win a ribbon anyway.', '2005-11-09 15:48:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1851728, 252237, 25742, '<td valign="top">good idea and well done</td>', 'good idea and well done', '2005-11-09 15:49:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1851949, 250915, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture - I like it a lot and think it suited the challenge perfectly. I like the composition and the focus, everything well focused except the moving hands. Wish is had gotten a better score for you - it''s so hard to know what people will like. I gave you a 9!</td>', 'This is a nice picture - I like it a lot and think it suited the challenge perfectly. I like the composition and the focus, everything well focused except the moving hands. Wish is had gotten a better score for you - it''s so hard to know what people will like. I gave you a 9!', '2005-11-09 16:44:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(1852089, 252491, 46020, '<td valign="top">Very Nice.</td>', 'Very Nice.', '2005-11-09 17:30:55.000000', NULL, 0),
