(1858169, 252496, 19670, '<td valign="top">In case you thought my Shutter Speed entry (Glass Emanations) was too abstract (which, upon review, I agree with now) and didn''t know what it was, here''s a quick snap of the window over our front door: <a href="//www.nagyworld.com/DavidsPhotos/images/IMG_5786small.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Our window</a> <br/>I erroneously thought it was understandable that it was a blurred shot of a shelf with glass vases. I''m so used to seeing it I neglected to realize that others wouldn''t see it as I do. There''s a lesson to learn in photography! Thanks to those that commented.</td>', 'In case you thought my Shutter Speed entry (Glass Emanations) was too abstract (which, upon review, I agree with now) and didn''t know what it was, here''s a quick snap of the window over our front door: Our window I erroneously thought it was understandable that it was a blurred shot of a shelf with glass vases. I''m so used to seeing it I neglected to realize that others wouldn''t see it as I do. There''s a lesson to learn in photography! Thanks to those that commented.', '2005-11-11 13:17:22.000000', NULL, 0),
